    'This is the page you publish on the site telling the public how accessible it is and who to contact. In the EU and the UK, publishing one is a legal obligation.' => 'This is the page you publish on the site telling the public how accessible it is and who to contact. In the EU and the UK, publishing one is a legal obligation.',
    'A VPAT answers a different question, for a buyer who asked for it. Plenty of organisations need both, and the two share their organisation and contact details.' => 'A VPAT answers a different question, for a buyer who asked for it. Plenty of organisations need both, and the two share their organisation and contact details.',
