    'An enforcement body is required: the national body somebody escalates to when your own answer has not satisfied them.' => 'An enforcement body is required: the national body somebody escalates to when your own answer has not satisfied them.',
    'Shortfalls must be split three ways. A non-compliance is work you owe; a disproportionate burden is an exemption you have to justify and review; out-of-scope content is simply not covered.' => 'Shortfalls must be split three ways. A non-compliance is work you owe; a disproportionate burden is an exemption you have to justify and review; out-of-scope content is simply not covered.',
    'The statement must say how it was prepared and when it was last reviewed.' => 'The statement must say how it was prepared and when it was last reviewed.',
    'The three shortfall categories are still worth using: they read very differently to somebody deciding whether you are taking this seriously.' => 'The three shortfall categories are still worth using: they read very differently to somebody deciding whether you are taking this seriously.',
    'Why full compliance is held back' => 'Why full compliance is held back',
    'Automated testing reaches about a third of WCAG. It can tell you an image has no alt text; it cannot tell you whether the alt text you wrote is any use, or whether a keyboard user can get through your checkout. A scanner finding nothing has not established that there is nothing to find.' => 'Automated testing reaches about a third of WCAG. It can tell you an image has no alt text; it cannot tell you whether the alt text you wrote is any use, or whether a keyboard user can get through your checkout. A scanner finding nothing has not established that there is nothing to find.',
    'So the claim is lowered on the evidence and never raised by it. To state full compliance, confirm the manual review under Preparation, or sign the criteria off individually on the VPAT.' => 'So the claim is lowered on the evidence and never raised by it. To state full compliance, confirm the manual review under Preparation, or sign the criteria off individually on the VPAT.',
    'Stating something narrower than the evidence suggests is always yours to do: you may well know something the scanner does not.' => 'Stating something narrower than the evidence suggests is always yours to do: you may well know something the scanner does not.',
